// Synthetic: a KDC_ERR_PREAUTH_REQUIRED error that names the client and realm of the AS request, which Suricata often logs as `<empty>` in errors. The KDC asks every regular logon for preauthentication, so the error becomes an informational Preauth failure of Authentication.
from_file env("TENZIR_INPUT") {
  read_suricata
}
suricata::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(ocsf_derive(this))
drop_null_fields
